{"5056850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Woodbound", "steam_appid": 5056850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hearing a familiar voice calling from deep within the woods, you venture into a cursed forest in search of someone you refuse to give up on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided only by a lantern, you'll navigate twisting paths, evade terrifying creatures, and uncover the dark secrets hidden beneath the ancient trees. Every shrine you light brings you closer to the truth—but not every path leads to salvation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person survival horror gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dense forest filled with secrets and hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive deadly creatures using limited resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your starting equipment to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings based on your choices and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery through exploration and environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After hearing a familiar voice calling from deep within the woods, you venture into a cursed forest in search of someone you refuse to give up on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided only by a lantern, you'll navigate twisting paths, evade terrifying creatures, and uncover the dark secrets hidden beneath the ancient trees. Every shrine you light brings you closer to the truth—but not every path leads to salvation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person survival horror gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dense forest filled with secrets and hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive deadly cre